WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:01.930
We did it!

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.259
Thank you so much for
helping us 'fill up the carrot.'

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:06.313
We reached our goal

00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:10.050
with your amazing contributions
to NutritionFacts.org.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.420
Your generous
support enables us

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.780
to continue to scour
the medical journals,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.080
create content to share,

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.040
and highlight the latest in
evidence-based nutrition

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.680
to help you and others around
the world live healthier lives.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.520
We appreciate each and every
one of our supporters;

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:30.130
you are truly the backbone of
our nonprofit organization.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.406
Thank you.

